    "name": "cancelRequest",
    "label": "Cancel a Request",
    "description": "Withdraws a pending request: the link stops working, the recipient can no longer complete it, and a request.canceled event reaches Watch Requests. An already completed, expired or canceled request answers REQUEST_NOT_PENDING.",
